    narr:generatedFrom "b2ec289d3195075bfc545f4425d71863e7c5d7be" ;
    narr:narration """[Quinton Fairweather opens by announcing that every Meridian deployment now requires a signed release manifest before it ships, framing it as a settled operational decision](narr:Expr_20261008_1_ProtectedBaseProbe_hfaec2f6da2c2_1), then [grounds the requirement in a concrete incident, recalling that two unsigned artifacts reached staging last quarter and calling that the whole reason for the gate](narr:Expr_20261008_1_ProtectedBaseProbe_hfaec2f6da2c2_2). The exchange is then formalized: [Xena Expertgh enters the gate itself into the decision register, naming the signed-manifest requirement for Meridian deploys](narr:Expr_20261008_1_ProtectedBaseProbe_hfaec2f6da2c2_3), [sets its scope as covering both staging and production environments](narr:Expr_20261008_1_ProtectedBaseProbe_hfaec2f6da2c2_4), and [attributes ownership of the decision to Quinton Fairweather](narr:Expr_20261008_1_ProtectedBaseProbe_hfaec2f6da2c2_5).""" ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_20261008_1_ProtectedBaseProbe_hfaec2f6da2c2_1> ;
